# The choice made as a permanent enters is no copiable value (CR 707.2): Clone entering as a copy of Dauntless Bodyguard
# makes its own choice as it enters (CR 707.5, 614.12a), and its abilities, the Bodyguard's text, refer to it (CR 607.2d).
# The original chose Ornithopter; the copy chooses the original Bodyguard, and sacrificing the copy makes the original
# indestructible, not Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Dauntless Bodyguard
Clone
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dauntless Bodyguard.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clone.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Dauntless Bodyguard)
Bot1.Choose(Dauntless Bodyguard)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dauntless Bodyguard#1.ChosenObject = Ornithopter
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dauntless Bodyguard#2.ChosenObject = Dauntless Bodyguard
Bot1.Battlefield.Dauntless Bodyguard#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter; Dauntless Bodyguard
Bot1.Battlefield.Dauntless Bodyguard.Keywords = Indestructible
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
